                                                "sense_id": "ad3c5957-bc15-3901-9c6c-5038e2ae43a5",
                                                "text": "Analysts and opinion polls had forecast losses for the ANC but a pivotal factor in the party’s staggering decline was former President Jacob Zuma and his newly formed uMkhonto weSizwe (MK) party, which capitalized on widespread discontent within the ANC’s traditional voter base."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
